 -40","description":"Trace scene 2-1 kills and cover time with the fair bot","timeout":200000}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01Eyg14jZEZjdN8PwK2XCphz":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183153__xf5fb84/work/TideCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183153"}}}
