{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PvZputSC4hBSypYpRbHe7j","type":"tool_result","content":"9:  tech: 'my-3D2dge handoff v0.85.2 full engine (patched: long guns, PlayStation glyphs, wheel codes, audio buses), our own perspective software renderer module (Rail3D) drawing into the engine\\'s pixel buffer, AI Hub session client 1.4.0 (protocol 1); plain \n14:  testing: 'Allowed: headless tools as much as liked (game.advance and game.debug), screenshots only for what a script cannot check, one command that prints only failures and a count, no subagents or workflows to review. Used: node tests/run.mjs, 26 suites:\n18:  usage: 'unknown: the API cost in USD and the token count are not visible from inside the session. Session time 2 h 16 min, measured from 18:31:53 to 20:48:28 when the final build was made'\n20:const FEEDBACK = {\n21:  testing: [\n22:    '56, itemised in tests/ISSUES.md: 48 in the game (22 caught by the bot playthroughs and boss runs, 10 cover points caught by the content validator, 1 caught by the UI suite, 15 caught by screenshots) and 8 in the bot used for testing.',\n44:  source: SOURCE, feedback: FEEDBACK, hub: HUBINFO,\n49:    { title: 'SOURCE INFORMATION (3)', rows: [['ONLINE', SOURCE.online], ['TESTING', SOURCE.testing], ['RESEARCH', SOURCE.research], ['ENVIRONMENT', SOURCE.environment], ['MODEL', SOURCE.model], ['USAGE', SOURCE.usage]] },\n50:    { title: 'TESTING FEEDBACK', rows: [['ISSUES CAUGHT', FEEDBACK.testing[0]], ['CRITICAL', FEEDBACK.testing[1]], ['MOST HELPFUL TEST', FEEDBACK.testing[2]], ['LEAST HELPFUL TEST', FEEDBACK.testing[3]]] },\n51:    { title: 'ENGINE FEEDBACK', rows: [['LIKED MOST', FEEDBACK.engine[0]], ['STUCK OR WRONG', FEEDBACK.engine[1]], ['BUILT OURSELVES', FEEDBACK.engine[2]]] },\n52:    { title: 'ENGINE FEEDBACK (2)', rows: [['HARDEST PART', FEEDBACK.engine[3]], ['CHANGED IN THE ENGINE', FEEDBACK.engine[4]], ['ONE CHANGE', FEEDBACK.engine[5]]] },\n53:    { title: 'PROMPT FEEDBACK', r