{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016cwvxTgX68L6kqFj8FvARn","type":"tool_result","content":"  testing: 'Allowed: headless tools as much as liked (game.advance and game.debug), screenshots only for what a script cannot check, one command that prints only failures and a count, no subagents or workflows to review. Used: node tests/run.mjs, 26 suites: 23 headless (core, gameplay, content, UI, dev, attract, co-op and a FakeHub net suite with latency, jitter and loss) plus --playthrough (the expert bot clears every stage, the fair bot clears every stage on Normal without a continue, the showoff bot plays the whole ARCADE with its cutscenes, Training completes), --browser (the bundle at four window sizes) and --hub (the four AI Hub harness scenarios in headless Chromium); tests/ISSUES.md logs what they caught',\n  testing: [\n    '56, itemised in tests/ISSUES.md: 48 in the game (22 caught by the bot playthroughs and boss runs, 10 cover points caught by the content validator, 1 caught by the UI suite, 15 caught by screenshots) and 8 in the bot used for testing.',\n    '13 were critical: an area, a boss or a mode could not be finished. The Bulldog fuel tank inside its collider (1-3); canal enemies left behind the boat (1-4); Barracuda boarding outside the view (1-B); a shield trooper with no hide state (3-1) and one stuck in his crouch; funicular terraces misplaced and hidden by parapets (2-3); rappellers stuck on the lift ropes (3-4); a lighthouse collider hiding an enemy (2-4); Hammerhead shielded down to his shins and his rig turned to NaN (2-B); the Seawolf hovering out of view (3-2); Training able to reach CONTINUE.',\n    'The bot playthroughs: the Autopilot playing every stage headless through game.advance (expert in god mode for completion, fair on Normal for balance, showoff for the whole ARCADE with its cutscenes). They caught every critical issue and gave the clear times the area timers are set from.',\n    'The 3D math and rasterizer unit tests (math3d, raster): they guard projection, rays and depth but caught nothing; every renderer problem was caught by screenshots instead.'\n  ],\n  engine: [\n30:const mods = ['core', 'gameplay', 'content', 'ui', 'net'];\n24 build,math3d,raster,determinism,audio,cover,weapons,player,timer,scoring,enemies,threats,projectiles,objects,bosses,coop,content,lighthouse,story,ui,input,dev,attract,net","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a","uuid":"3d5005d3-b170-4c52-92d4-3f7d8d52c425","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:25:57.329Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"  testing: 'Allowed: headless tools as much as liked (game.advance and game.debug), screenshots only for what a script cannot check, one command that prints only failures and a count, no subagents or workflows to review. Used: node tests/run.mjs, 26 suites: 23 headless (core, gameplay, content, UI, dev, attract, co-op and a FakeHub net suite with latency, jitter and loss) plus --playthrough (the expert bot clears every stage, the fair bot clears every stage on Normal without a continue, the showoff bot plays the whole ARCADE with its cutscenes, Training completes), --browser (the bundle at four window sizes) and --hub (the four AI Hub harness scenarios in headless Chromium); tests/ISSUES.md logs what they caught',\n  testing: [\n    '56, itemised in tests/ISSUES.md: 48 in the game (22 caught by the bot playthroughs and boss runs, 10 cover points caught by the content validator, 1 caught by the UI suite, 15 caught by screenshots) and 8 in the bot used for testing.',\n    '13 were critical: an area, a boss or a mode could not be finished. The Bulldog fuel tank inside its collider (1-3); canal enemies left behind the boat (1-4); Barracuda boarding outside the view (1-B); a shield trooper with no hide state (3-1) and one stuck in his crouch; funicular terraces misplaced and hidden by parapets (2-3); rappellers stuck on the lift ropes (3-4); a lighthouse collider hiding an enemy (2-4); Hammerhead shielded down to his shins and his rig turned to NaN (2-B); the Seawolf hovering out of view (3-2); Training able to reach CONTINUE.',\n    'The bot playthroughs: the Autopilot playing every stage headless through game.advance (expert in god mode for completion, fair on Normal for balance, showoff for the whole ARCADE with its cutscenes). They caught every critical issue and gave the clear times the area timers are set from.',\n    'The 3D math and rasterizer unit tests (math3d, raster): they guard projection, rays and depth but caught nothing; every renderer problem was caught by screenshots instead.'\n  ],\n  engine: [\n30:const mods = ['core', 'gameplay', 'content', 'ui', 'net'];\n24 build,math3d,raster,determinism,audio,cover,weapons,player,timer,scoring,enemies,threats,projectiles,objects,bosses,coop,content,lighthouse,story,ui,input,dev,attract,net","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016cwvxTgX68L6kqFj8FvARn","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
