{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghFfZ5kHJmDLL5LCDsn3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"24 headless suites now, plus `--playthrough`, `--browser`, `e2e` and `--hub`: 28 in all. Updating the issue log with the nine game issues these new tests and screenshots caught:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1256,"cache_read_input_tokens":339186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1256},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a","uuid":"0f3d3b26-f694-4840-8ff8-563d986431bd","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:26:19.228Z","request_id":"req_011CghFfYk9z23eYKwiQXKJr"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghFfZ5kHJmDLL5LCDsn3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0134zpW9tJQbqXSKN3fkNszU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='tests/ISSUES.md'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"## Caught by the UI suite\\n\"\nnew=\"\"\"## Caught by the lighthouse and tower-roof checks (`lighthouse`: bot runs of 2-4, 2-B and 3-B, measured)\n| # | Issue | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| 59 | The gallery floor's square collider stuck out past the round floor into the stair, hiding a deckhand from the landing | a cross of two boxes inside the circle |\n| 60 | In the Krake fight player 1 ducked in the gap between two consoles, and player 4 stood outside the control room's glass | a front row of four consoles, one in front of each player |\n\n## Caught by the browser end-to-end suite (`e2e`: real key presses, mouse, touch, a stubbed DualSense)\n| # | Issue | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| 61 | Mouse hover moved the focus in menus and the dev panel only after a click, not after a key press | hover follows the pointer whenever it moves |\n| 62 | Escape with the dev panel open opened the pause menu over it instead of closing the panel | play is not pausable while the panel is open |\n| 63 | The fix for 62 left the pause screen up over the panel, holding every key | Dev mode closes the pause screen |\n| 65 | Scenes guarded their input with game.menuOpen, a property the engine does not have (harmless: a menu pauses the game) | game.paused |\n\n## Caught by the UI suite\n\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold=\"| 56 | Long About pages were cut off at the bottom of the screen (pages now flow) |\\n\"\nnew=old+\"\"\"| 57 | Every ride between areas started at its destination: the camera jumped ahead, back to the start of the path, and rode again (the previous slots were read after the scene changed) |\n| 58 | The lighthouse climb did not match the plan: steps under the gallery floor, a ride beside the tower wall and through the gallery floor, the stair deckhands shot from the courtyard (now an outside stair of nearly two turns to a gate in the railing; the players climb to a landing mid-fight, the clock stopped, and shoot up at two deckhands on the turn above; the ride into 2-B climbs the rest) |\n| 64 | The attract mode's DEMO PLAY bar hid the HUD's score and TIME labels; the touch-only notice was drawn over the TIME plate |\n\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold=s[s.index(\"## Totals\"):]\nnew=\"\"\"## Totals\n- **65 issues caught by testing**: 57 in the game (22 from the bot runs, 10 from the content validator, 2 from the\n  lighthouse and tower-roof checks, 1 from the UI suite, 4 from the browser end-to-end suite, 18 from screenshots) and 8\n  in the bot used for testing.\n- **13 critical** (1 to 13).\n- Found by reviewing the build against the plan rather than by a test (tests added since): only 4 of the 6 intel\n  bottles were placed; the first ARCADE start did not offer Training.\n- Caught nothing: the 3D math and rasterizer unit tests (`math3d`, `raster`).\n\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\n\np='src/99-about.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"Used: node tests/run.mjs, 26 suites: 23 headless (core, gameplay, content, UI, dev, attract, co-op and a FakeHub net suite with latency, jitter and loss) plus --playthrough (the expert bot clears every stage, the fair bot clears every stage on Normal without a continue, the showoff bot plays the whole ARCADE with its cutscenes, Training completes), --browser (the bundle at four window sizes) and --hub (the four AI Hub harness scenarios in headless Chromium); tests/ISSUES.md logs what they caught\"\nnew=\"Used: node tests/run.mjs, 28 suites: 24 headless (core, gameplay, content, the lighthouse climb and the tower roof, UI, dev, attract, co-op and a FakeHub net suite with latency, jitter and loss) plus --playthrough (the expert bot clears every stage, the fair bot clears every stage on Normal without a continue, the showoff bot plays the whole ARCADE with its cutscenes, Training completes), --browser (the bundle at four window sizes, then an end-to-end run with real key presses, mouse, touch and a stubbed DualSense: the attract mode, every About page, prompts following the device, dev mode from the pause menu, detail per stage, a touch-only phone) and --hub (the four AI Hub harness scenarios in headless Chromium); tests/ISSUES.md logs what they caught\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold=\"'56, itemised in tests/ISSUES.md: 48 in the game (22 caught by the bot playthroughs and boss runs, 10 cover points caught by the content validator, 1 caught by the UI suite, 15 caught by screenshots) and 8 in the bot used for testing.'\"\nnew=\"'65, itemised in tests/ISSUES.md: 57 in the game (22 caught by the bot playthroughs and boss runs, 10 cover points caught by the content validator, 2 caught by the lighthouse and tower-roof checks, 1 caught by the UI suite, 4 caught by the browser end-to-end suite, 18 caught by screenshots) and 8 in the bot used for testing.'\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"engine: \\[\" -A3 src/99-about.js | cut -c1-600","description":"Update issue log and About testing text"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1256,"cache_read_input_tokens":339186,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1256},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a","uuid":"9b4664bd-8267-4e4b-a962-8e3fe0da9b94","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:26:32.665Z","request_id":"req_011CghFfYk9z23eYKwiQXKJr","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0134zpW9tJQbqXSKN3fkNszU":{"comm