back to the handgun'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'switch time blocks firing'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a hit costs a life'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'invulnerable just after'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'extra life at 150,000'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'out of lives: CONTINUE?'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a continue restores lives and resets the score'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'no continue: game over'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'the life ring gives a life'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'TIME does not run while travelling'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'TIME runs in action'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'TIME EXTEND'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'TIME refills to 60%'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a clear adds the time bonus'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'chain ×1.1 at 5'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'chain caps at ×2'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a miss resets the chain'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'rank S'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'rank A'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'rank B'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'rank C'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'rank D after a continue'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a headshot kill scores hit + kill + headshot'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a deckhand hides, peeks and fires'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a hiding deckhand is behind its cover'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'aiming at the head kills'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'quartermaster drops machine-gun ammo'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'the shield has a shield volume'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a handgun shot on the shield does nothing'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'the shotgun knocks the shield aside'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'cover blocks the rusher slash'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'the sniper lasers and threatens'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a drone flies'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a dead drone falls and is gone'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a jet ski moves along its path'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a jet ski leaves at the end'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'hitting the hostage costs a life'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'minGap between impacts'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'maxThreats caps chance threats'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'an exposed player is hit'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'cover blocks a threat'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'pop-out protection slides the impact'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'misses never damage'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a rocket is launched with its threat'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a rocket can be shot down'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'cover does not stop a torpedo'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'explosions hurt enemies, never players'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'barrels chain-explode'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a breakable removes its collider'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a civilian hit costs 5,000 and a life'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'Rook is there in single player'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'shots pass through allies (with a bark)'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'a bottle is intel'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'hammerhead swaps the cover'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'scylla topples and Krake takes the final shot'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'two players, two cameras'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'independent cover'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'pickups go to the killer'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'one player out: the other plays on'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'co-op continue'\ntests/gameplay.suite.mjs:'four slots for the hub'","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017R2U5LupkroyJq8jo64i7Y","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
