{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011PYeHxryYVT7BiyvcjFDaX","type":"tool_result","content":"e2e: the page is our game\ne2e: boots to the title\ne2e: 10 s idle on the title starts the attract mode\ne2e: the attract demo plays itself (a bot shooting, cheating)\ne2e: the demo is drawn\ne2e: any key leaves the attract mode for the title\ne2e: title -> menu (Enter)\ne2e: keyboard prompts after a key\ne2e: hovering ABOUT moves the menu focus to it\ne2e: clicking ABOUT opens the About screen\ne2e: Escape goes back to the menu\ne2e: up from ARCADE wraps to ABOUT\ne2e: Enter opens About\ne2e: Right pages through all \ne2e: Left from the first page goes to the last\ne2e: the About pages at this window size hold every exit-interview answer\ne2e: the pages include Source Information and the three feedback sections\ne2e: back to the menu\ne2e: the pad d-pad moves the menu (to RECORDS)\ne2e: prompts follow the pad\ne2e: Cross picks RECORDS\ne2e: PlayStation glyphs by default (back is Circle)\ne2e: the Xbox option shows A B X Y (back is B)\ne2e: a key press switches the prompts back to keys\ne2e: Circle goes back to the menu\ne2e: STAGE SELECT focused\ne2e: stage 1, Normal -> the briefing\ne2e: Escape skips the briefing into play\ne2e: the first area reaches ACTION\ne2e: Escape pauses\ne2e: the pause menu has Dev mode, reached with the arrow keys\ne2e: Dev mode opens from the pause menu\ne2e: the game is frozen while the panel is open\ne2e: Right moves the focused slider (a live value)\ne2e: RESET asks first\ne2e: RESET restores every default\ne2e: E switches tabs (VIEW)\ne2e: Enter toggles the perf overlay\ne2e: ACTIONS tab\ne2e: Kill all\ne2e: Spawn enemy (the type chosen with Right)\ne2e: Bot plays\ne2e: Escape closes the panel and the game runs\ne2e: the bot plays the area\ne2e: stage \ne2e: no errors on the desktop page\ne2e touch: boots to the title\ne2e touch: detected as touch-only\ne2e touch: the settings button opens Settings\ne2e touch: a tap on Close shuts it\ne2e touch: the attract mode still runs\ne2e touch: the demo plays under the notice\ne2e touch: no errors","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a","uuid":"48bf75f0-94d7-4a1b-aa71-4339de0663ae","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:42:26.663Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"e2e: the page is our game\ne2e: boots to the title\ne2e: 10 s idle on the title starts the attract mode\ne2e: the attract demo plays itself (a bot shooting, cheating)\ne2e: the demo is drawn\ne2e: any key leaves the attract mode for the title\ne2e: title -> menu (Enter)\ne2e: keyboard prompts after a key\ne2e: hovering ABOUT moves the menu focus to it\ne2e: clicking ABOUT opens the About screen\ne2e: Escape goes back to the menu\ne2e: up from ARCADE wraps to ABOUT\ne2e: Enter opens About\ne2e: Right pages through all \ne2e: Left from the first page goes to the last\ne2e: the About pages at this window size hold every exit-interview answer\ne2e: the pages include Source Information and the three feedback sections\ne2e: back to the menu\ne2e: the pad d-pad moves the menu (to RECORDS)\ne2e: prompts follow the pad\ne2e: Cross picks RECORDS\ne2e: PlayStation glyphs by default (back is Circle)\ne2e: the Xbox option shows A B X Y (back is B)\ne2e: a key press switches the prompts back to keys\ne2e: Circle goes back to the menu\ne2e: STAGE SELECT focused\ne2e: stage 1, Normal -> the briefing\ne2e: Escape skips the briefing into play\ne2e: the first area reaches ACTION\ne2e: Escape pauses\ne2e: the pause menu has Dev mode, reached with the arrow keys\ne2e: Dev mode opens from the pause menu\ne2e: the game is frozen while the panel is open\ne2e: Right moves the focused slider (a live value)\ne2e: RESET asks first\ne2e: RESET restores every default\ne2e: E switches tabs (VIEW)\ne2e: Enter toggles the perf overlay\ne2e: ACTIONS tab\ne2e: Kill all\ne2e: Spawn enemy (the type chosen with Right)\ne2e: Bot plays\ne2e: Escape closes the pan